#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:1
#: 8f16c78409f34000b774b0bc764b09c0
msgid "训练集评估（Training Set Audit）"
msgstr "Training-set audit (Training Set Audit)"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:3
#: 6699bedd19ba4fbe95b17c97b4e01057
msgid ""
"训练集评估用于检查当前训练数据：先找会阻止训练的技术问题，再查看组分、标签、 局域环境、结构相和磁类型如何分布。每一项结果都能回到 `NEP "
"Dataset Display` 中的原始结构。"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit checks the current training data. It first finds "
"technical issues that would block training, then examines the "
"distributions of composition, labels, local environments, structural "
"phases, and magnetic types. Every result can be traced back to the "
"original structure in `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:21
#: dcfd399bd4d74369aa717953894d68d7
msgid "从数据集查看进入"
msgstr "Open it from Dataset Display"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:23
