msgstr "Run the complete audit on the active structures"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:7
#: 3471d396a4c34b0db5814449a2e685fb
msgid "左侧图表工具栏 → `查看数据分布`"
msgstr "Plot toolbar → `Explore distributions`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:7
#: 6df085e7882940b29852ad79d47d166d
msgid "「数据地图」→「数据分布」"
msgstr "`Data map` → `Data distribution`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:7
#: 9086731d725e4f679e91f37d830d421d
msgid "查看能量、力、virial、预测值或误差分布"
msgstr "Inspect energy, force, virial, predictions, or error distributions"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:30
#: 5244a192130849d298340a37c56686ff
msgid ""
"评估默认只读取当前活动结构；已删除结构不在本次范围内。删除结构、修改标签或切换 `nep.txt` "
"后，应点击「重新检查」，旧结果不能继续代表变化后的数据。"
msgstr ""
"By default, assessment reads only the current active structures; deleted "
"structures are out of scope. After deleting structures, changing labels, "
"or switching `nep.txt`, click `Recheck`; old results no longer represent "
"the changed data."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:33
#: 6291ebb304c84cb1b438d23a09b64253
msgid "按页面标签阅读"
msgstr "Read by page tab"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:35
#: 6c1638c6eb634594b6ac924ed159ad27
msgid "[概览与快速体检](training-audit-overview.md)：先处理阻塞项，再看建议复核项。"
msgstr ""
"[Overview and quick health check](training-audit-overview.md): handle "
"blocking issues first, then review recommended checks."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:36
#: 3e039662804441e0944f34836485afb7
