msgstr ""
"[Data map](training-audit-data-map.md): inspect exact-composition, "
"structural-phase, and magnetic-type distributions."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:37
#: 2234f3cf5d85429e98fbb65ca36edd6b
msgid "[进阶证据](training-audit-advanced.md)：结合活动模型的 cutoff 检查局域环境。"
msgstr ""
"[Advanced evidence](training-audit-advanced.md): inspect local "
