msgstr ""
"[Targets and model](training-audit-target-model.md): compare coverage "
"rules only when a target space is defined."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:40
#: 8db772c25ce1465db58217764631bfa4
msgid ""
"[结构相识别](training-audit-phase.md)和[磁类型识别](training-audit-"
"magnetism.md)：核对判据与能力边界。"
msgstr ""
"[Structural-phase identification](training-audit-phase.md) and [magnetic-"
"type identification](training-audit-magnetism.md): check criteria and "
"capability boundaries."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:41
#: b84fcfaad86b4153bf9e224f706a264d
msgid "[导出报告与当前限制](training-audit-report.md)：留档、协作以及判断本页面不能回答的问题。"
msgstr ""
"[Export reports and current limitations](training-audit-report.md): "
"preserve results, collaborate, and identify questions this page cannot "
"answer."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:43
#: cdfe8de8ee3f4eecb2299ddc67ffdd35
msgid "这个页面给出的是**当前数据快照的证据**，不会仅凭一份训练集宣称物理空间已经完整覆盖， 也不会在缺少独立测试数据时判断势函数是否可靠。"
msgstr ""
"This page provides **evidence from the current data snapshot**. It does "
"not claim that the physical space is fully covered from one training set "
"alone, and it does not judge potential reliability without independent "
"test data."

#~ msgid "训练集评估"
#~ msgstr "Training Set Audit"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "「训练集评估」用于检查当前训练数据：先找会阻止训练的技术问题，再查看组分、标签、局域环境、结构相和磁类型在数据内部如何分布。每一项结果都能回到"
#~ " `NEP Dataset Display` 中的原始结构，便于继续查看、选择或导出。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Training Set Audit inspects the active"
#~ " training data in two stages: it "
#~ "first finds technical problems that can"
#~ " block training, then shows how "
#~ "composition, labels, local environments, "
#~ "structural phases, and magnetic types "
#~ "are distributed within the dataset. "
#~ "Every result keeps the original "
#~ "structure indices so that you can "
#~ "return to `NEP Dataset Display` to "
#~ "inspect, select, or export the affected"
#~ " structures."

#~ msgid "这个页面给出的是**当前数据快照的证据**。它不会仅凭一份训练集宣称物理空间已经完整覆盖，也不会在缺少独立测试数据时判断势函数是否可靠。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This page reports **evidence from the"
#~ " current dataset snapshot**. A training "
#~ "set alone cannot prove complete coverage"
#~ " of physical space, and model "
#~ "reliability cannot be established without "
#~ "independent test data."

#~ msgid "从 `NEP Dataset Display` 进入"
#~ msgstr "Open the audit from `NEP Dataset Display`"

#~ msgid "训练集评估的「概览」"
#~ msgstr "Training Set Audit → `Overview`"

#~ msgid "直接查看能量、力、virial、预测值或误差的分布"
#~ msgstr "Inspect distributions of energy, force, virial, predictions, or errors"

#~ msgid "没有加载数据时，入口会提示先打开数据集。评估默认只读取当前活动结构；已删除结构不在本次范围内。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If no data is loaded, NepTrainKit "
#~ "asks you to open a dataset first."
#~ " The audit covers the active "
#~ "structures only; structures already removed"
#~ " from the dataset are outside the "
#~ "audit scope."

#~ msgid "数据变化后要重新检查"
#~ msgstr "Re-run the audit after the data changes"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "页面顶部会显示结构范围、数据指纹和生成时间。删除结构、切换数据、修改标签或切换 `nep.txt` "
#~ "后，请点击「重新检查」。旧结果不能继续代表已经变化的数据。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The header records the audited structure"
#~ " range, data fingerprint, and generation"
#~ " time. Click `Re-run checks` after"
#~ " deleting structures, switching datasets, "
#~ "editing labels, or changing `nep.txt`. "
#~ "An earlier result no longer represents"
#~ " the modified data."

#~ msgid "推荐操作顺序"
#~ msgstr "Recommended workflow"

#~ msgid "1. 先看「概览」"
#~ msgstr "Step 1: Start with Overview"

#~ msgid "「概览」先回答 3 个问题："
#~ msgstr "The Overview answers three questions:"

#~ msgid "有没有空结构、非法数值、标签形状错误等训练阻塞项；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Are there empty structures, non-finite"
#~ " values, invalid label shapes, or "
#~ "other training blockers?"

#~ msgid "当前数据包含哪些精确组分、元素和标签；"
#~ msgstr "Which exact compositions, elements, and labels are present?"

#~ msgid "哪些高力、高能量、重复或低频集合值得先复核。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Which high-force, high-energy, repeated,"
#~ " or low-frequency groups deserve "
#~ "review first?"

#~ msgid "点击复核项后，下方会显示观察事实、解释和能力边界。再点击显示结构按钮，即可返回原页面，并选中该项对应的真实结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Select a review topic to see the"
#~ " observation, interpretation, and capability "
#~ "boundary. Use the structure button to"
#~ " return to `NEP Dataset Display` with"
#~ " the affected structures selected."

#~ msgid "训练集评估概览页，标出当前结论、数据概况、建议复核顺序和 HTML 报告导出入口"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Training Set Audit overview with the "
#~ "conclusion, dataset metrics, recommended "
#~ "review order, and HTML export "
#~ "highlighted"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "图中的编号就是推荐阅读顺序：先读当前结论，再确认本次检查了多少结构和标签，随后按「建议下一步」进入复核队列。只有需要留档或发给合作者时，才使用右上角的"
#~ " HTML 导出。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Follow the numbered reading order in "
#~ "the screenshot: read the current "
#~ "conclusion, confirm how many structures "
#~ "and labels were checked, then use "
#~ "Recommended next steps to enter the "
#~ "review queue. Export HTML only when "
#~ "you need a durable record or a "
#~ "report for a collaborator."

#~ msgid "2. 在「数据地图」查看组分、相和磁类型"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Step 2: Inspect composition, structural "
#~ "phase, and magnetic type in Data "
#~ "map"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "「组分地图」按精确原子比例合并结构。例如，`Fe2Ni2`、`Fe4Ni4` 和 `Fe32Ni32` "
#~ "都归入同一个 `Fe:Ni = 1:1` 组分点。右侧表格仍保留结构数量、原子数和 "
#~ "`Config_type`，不会把不同尺寸的结构当成同一个结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The composition map groups structures by"
#~ " exact atomic ratio. For example, "
#~ "`Fe2Ni2`, `Fe4Ni4`, and `Fe32Ni32` all "
#~ "belong to the same `Fe:Ni = 1:1`"
#~ " composition point. The table still "
#~ "records the number of structures, atom"
#~ " counts, and `Config_type`, so structures"
#~ " with different cell sizes are not"
#~ " treated as the same geometry."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "第一次进入时，柱高表示该浓度下的结构数。基础诊断显示后，页面默认自动在后台遍历当前评估范围内的所有结构；不需要另找按钮启动。大体系如果不希望自动分析，可在「设置"
#~ " → 个性化」中关闭「自动分析结构证据」。分析完成后会增加两种视图，但不会擅自切换当前组分图："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "On first entry, bar height represents"
#~ " the number of structures at that "
#~ "concentration. After the basic diagnostics "
#~ "appear, the page automatically scans all"
#~ " structures in the current audit "
#~ "scope in the background; no separate "
#~ "start button is required. For large "
#~ "systems, disable `Automatically analyze "
#~ "structure evidence` under Settings > "
#~ "Personalization if automatic analysis is "
#~ "not desired. Two additional views become"
#~ " available when analysis finishes, without"
#~ " changing the current composition view "
#~ "automatically:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**结构相：** FCC、HCP、BCC，以及通过保守模板确认的 "
#~ "A4、L1₀、L1₂、B1、B2、B3、B4、C1、B8₁、D0₃、L2₁、C1ᵦ、D0₁₉、C14、C15；其余显示为混合局域结构或未解析；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Structural phase:** FCC, HCP, and BCC,"
#~ " plus conservatively confirmed A4, L1₀, "
#~ "L1₂, B1, B2, B3, B4, C1, B8₁, "
#~ "D0₃, L2₁, C1ᵦ, D0₁₉, C14, and C15"
#~ " prototypes; all remaining structures are"
#~ " shown as mixed local structure or"
#~ " unresolved;"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**磁类型：** FM、AFM（未细分）、逐层 AFM（`↑↓`）、双层 AFM（`↑↑↓↓`）、FiM"
#~ "、PM-like（自旋无序）、其他非共线、未识别、低／零磁矩和无有效 `spin` 字段。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Magnetic type:** FM, AFM (unsubtyped), "
#~ "layered AFM (`↑↓`), double-layer AFM "
#~ "(`↑↑↓↓`), FiM, PM-like (spin-"
#~ "disordered), other noncollinear, unresolved, "
#~ "low/zero moment, and no valid `spin` "
#~ "field."

#~ msgid "分析结束后，可以先选组分，再用结构相和磁类型下拉框继续筛选。点击「查看选中的结构」即可回到 `NEP Dataset Display`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "When analysis finishes, select a "
#~ "composition and refine it with the "
#~ "structural-phase and magnetic-type "
#~ "filters. Click `Show selected structures` "
#~ "to return to `NEP Dataset Display`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "相和磁是两条独立证据。同一个 FCC 或 BCC "
#~ "骨架可以承载不同磁结构，所以页面不会把它们合成一个不可拆分的标签。`Config_type` "
#~ "只是来源元数据，不参与结构相或磁类型判断。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Structural phase and magnetism are "
#~ "independent evidence layers. The same "
#~ "FCC or BCC framework can carry "
#~ "different magnetic structures, so the "
#~ "interface does not collapse them into"
#~ " a single inseparable label. `Config_type`"
#~ " is source metadata only and does "
#~ "not participate in structural-phase or"
#~ " magnetic-type classification."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "在「进阶证据 → 磁序」中还可以切换三张按结构帧数归一化的 100% "
#~ "堆叠图：每个结构相中的磁类型占比、每个磁类型中的结构相占比，以及整个评估范围的磁类型占比。颜色段中的百分比和右侧帧数分别回答“占多少”和“有多少帧”；点击任一颜色段可回选对应结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Under `Advanced evidence → Magnetic "
#~ "order`, switch among three 100% stacked"
#~ " charts normalized by structure-frame "
#~ "count: magnetic-type shares within each"
#~ " structural phase, structural-phase shares"
#~ " within each magnetic type, and "
#~ "magnetic-type shares across the full "
#~ "audit scope. Percentages inside colored "
#~ "segments show the share, counts at "
#~ "the right show the number of "
#~ "frames, and clicking a segment selects"
#~ " its structures."

#~ msgid "训练集评估的磁类型占比视图，显示图表切换、结构帧占比、颜色图例和结构回选入口"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Magnetic-type share view with chart "
#~ "switching, structure-frame percentages, a "
#~ "color legend, and the structure-"
#~ "selection action"

#~ msgid "训练集评估的组分地图，标出证据层切换、相分布柱图、精确组分表和结构回选控件"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Composition map with controls for "
#~ "evidence-layer selection, phase-colored "
#~ "bars, exact-composition groups, and "
#~ "sending structures back to Dataset "
#~ "Display"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "上图使用的示例数据只有一个 `Pb:Te = 1:1` 精确组分点，而且 "
#~ "a-CNA "
#~ "和内置原型模板都没有给出强证据，因此柱子显示为灰色「未解析」。这不是程序出错，而是「当前几何证据不足以给出已支持标签」。如果数据带有有效"
#~ " `spin:R:3`，右上角证据层还会出现「按磁序着色」，下方磁序筛选框也会启用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The example above contains a single "
#~ "exact `Pb:Te = 1:1` composition point."
#~ " Neither a-CNA nor a built-in "
#~ "prototype template provides strong evidence,"
#~ " so the bar is gray and labeled"
#~ " unresolved. This is not an analysis"
#~ " failure: the current geometric evidence"
#~ " is insufficient for a supported "
#~ "label. With valid `spin:R:3` data, a "
#~ "magnetic-order coloring option appears "
#~ "in the evidence selector and the "
#~ "magnetic filter becomes available."

#~ msgid "3. 用「进阶证据」追到局域环境"
#~ msgstr "Step 3: Trace local environments in Advanced evidence"

#~ msgid "有活动的 `nep.txt` 时，页面会读取模型声明的元素及径向、角向 cutoff，并按模型实际可见的邻域统计："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With an active `nep.txt`, the audit "
#~ "reads the model elements and "
#~ "radial/angular cutoffs, then measures the "
#~ "neighborhoods that the model can "
#~ "actually see:"

#~ msgid "中心元素周围的配位数和近邻元素组成；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "coordination numbers and neighboring-element"
#~ " composition around each central element;"

#~ msgid "元素对是否共同出现、是否在 cutoff 内真正接触；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "whether element pairs merely coexist or"
#~ " actually come into contact inside "
#~ "the cutoff;"

#~ msgid "标签分布、高力尾部和高能量尾部。"
#~ msgstr "label distributions, the high-force tail, and the high-energy tail."

#~ msgid "没有 `nep.txt` 时，数据质量、组分、标签、结构相和磁类型仍可使用；依赖模型 cutoff 的局域化学与元素对接触会显示为不可用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Without `nep.txt`, data quality, composition,"
#~ " labels, structural phase, and magnetic "
#~ "type remain available. Local-chemistry "
#~ "and element-pair contact checks that "
#~ "require model cutoffs are marked "
#~ "unavailable."

#~ msgid "4. 在「复核队列」记录判断"
#~ msgstr "Step 4: Record decisions in Review queue"

#~ msgid "「复核队列」把相关的低频分箱合并为一个主题，避免同一问题产生大量重复提醒。状态选项会随问题类型变化：阻塞项可标为「未解决」或「已解决并重新检查」，重复几何可标记为「有意保留」「隔离候选」或「需要重算」，普通复核项可标记为「物理上合理」或「检查几何」。这些状态用于当前数据快照的页面复核，不会自动删除或修改结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The Review queue combines related "
#~ "low-frequency bins into one topic "
#~ "instead of producing many alerts for "
#~ "the same issue. Available states depend"
#~ " on the finding: blockers can be "
#~ "marked unresolved or resolved and "
#~ "rechecked; repeated geometries can be "
#~ "intentionally retained, isolated as "
#~ "candidates, or sent for recalculation; "
#~ "ordinary review groups can be marked "
#~ "physically expected or scheduled for "
#~ "geometry inspection. These states document "
#~ "the review of the current snapshot. "
#~ "They do not delete or modify "
