#~ msgid ""
#~ "这里 $\\oplus$ "
#~ "表示把两组数连接起来。程序计算该描述向量与内置参考晶体模板之间的最小均方根距离。物种检查使用同一组完整近邻壳，比较每一壳中的元素角色数。这样可以容忍整体平移、旋转、缩放、原子重排、元素编号变化和适度畸变，但不会仅凭化学计量、晶格常数或“看起来像立方”认相。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Here $\\oplus$ concatenates the two "
#~ "sorted sets. The audit computes the "
#~ "minimum root-mean-square distance "
#~ "between this descriptor and built-in "
#~ "reference-crystal templates. Species checks"
#~ " use the same complete neighbor "
#~ "shells and compare element-role counts"
#~ " in every shell. This tolerates "
#~ "translation, rotation, uniform scaling, atom"
#~ " reordering, species-ID relabeling, and "
#~ "moderate distortion, but does not assign"
#~ " a prototype from stoichiometry, lattice"
#~ " constants, or a merely cubic-looking"
#~ " cell."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "通用原型门槛为：组成比例相对理想值的偏差不超过 `3.5%`，几何匹配原子比例至少 `0.82`，化学匹配比例至少"
#~ " `0.80`，两者同时匹配的比例至少 `0.80`。每个局域环境使用不少于 14 "
#~ "个、且不截断完整壳层的近邻；壳层边界附近最多容许 `max(1, floor(0.08 K))` "
#~ "个近邻的排序交换。若两个已通过候选的局域形状距离和联合支持度都不足以明确拉开差距，结果直接返回「未解析」，不会按最接近模板猜一个标签。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For the common-prototype gate, "
#~ "composition may differ from the ideal"
#~ " ratio by at most `3.5%`; at "
#~ "least `0.82` of atoms must pass "
#~ "geometry, `0.80` must pass chemistry, "
#~ "and `0.80` must pass both. Each "
#~ "local environment uses at least 14 "
#~ "neighbors without truncating a complete "
#~ "shell. Near a shell boundary, at "
#~ "most `max(1, floor(0.08 K))` neighbor-"
#~ "ordering exchanges are tolerated. If two"
#~ " passing candidates are not clearly "
#~ "separated by local-shape distance or "
#~ "joint support, the result is unresolved"
#~ " rather than a nearest-template "
#~ "guess."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**L1₂：** 自动识别接近 `A:B = 1:3` 的二元组成。除了 "
#~ "FCC 形状外，还要求 A 位点的前 12 个近邻中没有 A、第二壳"
#~ " 6 个近邻全为 A；B 位点的前 12 个近邻中有 4"
#~ " 个 A、第二壳没有 A。几何匹配比例至少为 `0.80`，化学匹配比例至少为 "
#~ "`0.85`，几何与化学同时匹配的比例至少为 `0.80`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**L1₂:** identify a binary composition "
#~ "close to `A:B = 1:3`. In addition"
#~ " to an FCC-like shape, an A "
#~ "site must have no A atoms among"
#~ " its first 12 neighbors and six "
#~ "A atoms in the second shell; a "
#~ "B site must have four A atoms "
#~ "in the first 12 neighbors and no"
#~ " A atoms in the second shell. "
#~ "At least `0.80` of sites must pass"
#~ " geometry, `0.85` must pass chemistry, "
#~ "and `0.80` must pass both."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Laves：** 自动识别接近 `A:B = 1:2` 的二元组成。A"
#~ " 位点按 Z16 模板检查，B 位点按 Z12 模板检查；A "
#~ "位点应有 4 个 A 近邻，B 位点应有 6 个 "
#~ "A 近邻。几何匹配和联合匹配比例都至少为 `0.85`。通过后再用 B "
#~ "子晶格的中心对称参数区分 C14 与 C15。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Laves:** identify a binary composition "
#~ "close to `A:B = 1:2`. A sites "
#~ "are checked against a Z16 template "
#~ "and B sites against a Z12 "
#~ "template. An A site should have "
#~ "four A neighbors and a B site "
#~ "should have six A neighbors. Both "
#~ "the geometry pass fraction and the "
#~ "joint geometry-and-chemistry fraction "
#~ "must be at least `0.85`. C14 and"
#~ " C15 are then separated using the "
#~ "centrosymmetry parameter of the B "
#~ "sublattice."

