#~ msgstr ""
#~ "C15 has Pearson symbol `cF24` and "
#~ "space group $Fd\\bar 3m$. The `F` "
#~ "denotes a face-centered cubic Bravais"
#~ " lattice; it does not make the "
#~ "structure an A1 FCC solid solution "
#~ "or give every atom an FCC a-CNA"
#~ " neighborhood. The two C15 sites "
#~ "instead use the Z12/Z16 Frank–Kasper "
#~ "environments of a Laves phase. The "
#~ "interface can therefore report both `C15"
#~ " Laves confirmed` and `a-CNA (FCC/HCP/BCC"
#~ " only): other / unresolved`. See the"
#~ " [AFLOW C15 prototype](https://www.aflow.org"
#~ "/prototype-encyclopedia/A2B_cF24_227_d_a)."

